#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.eval.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.eval"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval:1 of
msgid "Evaluate a string describing operations on LiteFrame columns."
msgstr "求值描述对 LiteFrame 列进行操作的字符串。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval:3 of
msgid ""
"A pure expression returns a one-column LiteFrame (the LiteFrame analogue "
"of a pandas Series).  Assignment expressions (``C = A + B``) add or "
"replace a column; ``inplace=True`` mutates *lf*, otherwise a copy is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"纯表达式返回一个单列 LiteFrame（pandas Series 的 LiteFrame 对应物）。赋值"
"表达式（``C = A + B``）添加或替换列；``inplace=True`` 会就地修改 *lf*，"
"否则返回副本。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval:8 of
msgid ""
"Supported operators: ``+ - * / // % **``, ``== != < <= > >=``, ``& | ~``,"
" unary ``+ -``, ``abs()``, and ``in`` / ``not in`` against a constant "
"list.  ``@local`` references caller variables and backtick quoting "
"handles column names that are not valid identifiers."
msgstr ""
"支持的操作符：``+ - * / // % **``，``== != < <= > >=``，``& | ~``，一元"
"运算符 ``+ -``，``abs()``，以及针对常量列表的 ``in`` / ``not in``。``@"
"local`` 引用调用者变量，反引号引用处理无效标识符的列名。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval:13 of
msgid ""
"Expression string to evaluate.  Column names resolve to "
":func:`~maxframe.liteframe.col` expressions."
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval:16 of
msgid ""
"If ``True``, mutate *lf* in place for assignment expressions and return "
"``None``; a pure expression with ``inplace=True`` raises ``ValueError``."
"  If ``False``, return the resulting LiteFrame (for a pure expression) or"
" a mutated copy (for an assignment)."
msgstr ""
"如果为 ``True``，就地修改 *lf* 用于赋值表达式并返回 ``None``；纯表达式"
"使用 ``inplace=True`` 会引发 ``ValueError``。如果为 ``False``，返回结果 "
"LiteFrame（对于纯表达式）或修改后的副本（对于赋值）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval:21 of
msgid ""
"Additional keyword arguments forwarded to :func:`liteframe_eval`, such as"
" ``local_dict``, ``global_dict``, and ``level``."
msgstr ""
"转发给 :func:`liteframe_eval` 的附加关键字参数，例如 ``local_dict``、``"
"global_dict`` 和 ``level``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval:24 of
msgid ""
"A one-column LiteFrame for a pure expression, a mutated copy for a non-"
"inplace assignment, or ``None`` for an inplace assignment."
msgstr "纯表达式的单列 LiteFrame，非就地赋值的修改副本，或就地赋值的 ``None``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval:30 of
msgid ":py:obj:`query`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval:31 of
msgid "Query the columns of a LiteFrame with a boolean expression."
msgstr "使用布尔表达式查询 LiteFrame 的列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval:33 of
msgid ":py:obj:`assign`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.eval.lf_eval:34 of
msgid "Add new columns to LiteFrame."
msgstr "向 LiteFrame 添加新列。"

